WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:24.000
...The bunker, the sarcophagus and the portal are parts of one system. The sarcophagus will serve as a focusing element for the Object's energy...

2
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.500
...and the size of the Bunker is just perfect for mana-particle acceleration. Genius!

3
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Hm... Let me make an objection. Just one small miscalculation will lead to the allod's full destruction.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Exactly. That's why there will be no miscalculations.

5
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.500
It's a waste of time. You are ignoring the real results. My research...

6
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:56.500
...has been closed, and this decision is not a matter for discussion, colleague.

7
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:05.500
We will not test the Object on humans... or orcs. Only animals for now. And, by the way...

8
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:14.500
The staff at the Bestiary have achieved some amazing results in the study of the Specimen. I will head there tomorrow. Do you want to join me?

9
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.500
Of course...
